      "Hybrid final answers use runtime displays directly; neural result integration is not tested."
    ],
    "interface_finding": "Under the matched low-latency ICL interface, TwIL improves over SmolLM3 on only one of 22 exact items; valid IR executes exactly, but formalization dominates end-to-end failure.",
